# ── Code Owners ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub enforces that at least one owner approves any PR touching these paths.
# Configure branch protection (Settings → Branches → main → Require review from
# Code Owners) to make this mandatory.
#
# Paths are checked most-specific to least-specific; last matching rule wins.

# ── CI/CD & supply chain ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any change to workflow files or Dependabot config is high-risk supply chain.
/.github/ @pavlojs

# ── Build definition ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Decides what ends up inside the jar, what version it claims to be, and which
# Minecraft line it declares itself compatible with.
/build.gradle @pavlojs
/gradle.properties @pavlojs
/settings.gradle @pavlojs
/gradle/wrapper/ @pavlojs
/src/main/resources/META-INF/ @pavlojs

# ── Trust boundary ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every payload here arrives from a client that may be modified. The rule these
# files implement — that an open menu is the authorisation and no ItemStack
# crosses the wire — is the whole client-side security model.
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/network/ @pavlojs
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/menu/ @pavlojs

# ── Money ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Balances, physical coin arithmetic, and the exchange that moves both at once.
# A bug in any of these costs players something they cannot get back.
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/economy/ @pavlojs
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/shop/ @pavlojs
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/block/entity/ @pavlojs

# ── Permissions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The LuckPerms bridge grants real permissions in exchange for real money.
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/rank/ @pavlojs

# ── Money supply ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The minting recipe and the condition that switches it off are the server's
# monetary policy expressed as data.
/src/main/resources/data/ravencoin/recipe/ @pavlojs
/src/main/java/net/whiteravens/ravencoin/recipe/ @pavlojs

# ── Security & legal docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/SECURITY.md @pavlojs
/LICENSE @pavlojs
/NOTICE @pavlojs
